title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf script new
catalog: CLI command
target: mf script new
summary: Copy a template into the scripts directory, to adapt it (asks which one when none is named, on a terminal)

!! Reference

```
Copy a template into the scripts directory, to adapt it (asks which one when none is named, on a terminal)

Usage: mf script new [OPTIONS] [TEMPLATE]

Arguments:
  [TEMPLATE]
          The template, with or without `.sh` (`mf script` lists them)

Options:
      --name <NAME>
          The new script's name (default: the template's)

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
